    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for a reflection-capable LLM backend. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implement this to integrate any LLM that can generate, critique, and revise text. A single LLM can implement all four methods by forwarding to its <computeroutput>complete()</computeroutput> endpoint with appropriately constructed prompts — use <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_dynamic_reflection_prompt_builder" kindref="compound">DynamicReflectionPromptBuilder</ref></computeroutput> to construct those prompts.</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">class<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">MyLLMReflectionAdapter<sp/>:<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">public</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>IReflectionProvider<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>DynamicReflectionPromptBuilder<sp/>builder_;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>MyLLM<sp/>llm_;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">public</highlight><highlight class="normal">:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::string<sp/>generate(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::string&amp;<sp/>prompt)</highlight><highlight class="keyword"><sp/>const<sp/>override<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>llm_.complete(prompt);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::string<sp/>critique(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::string&amp;<sp/>p,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::string&amp;<sp/>r)</highlight><highlight class="keyword"><sp/>const<sp/>override<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>llm_.complete(builder_.buildCritiquePrompt(p,<sp/>r));</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::string<sp/>revise(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::string&amp;<sp/>p,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::string&amp;<sp/>r,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::string&amp;<sp/>c)</highlight><highlight class="keyword"><sp/>const<sp/>override<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>llm_.complete(builder_.buildRevisionPrompt(p,<sp/>r,<sp/>c));</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>score(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::string&amp;,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::string&amp;<sp/>r)</highlight><highlight class="keyword"><sp/>const<sp/>override<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>implement<sp/>quality<sp/>heuristic<sp/>or<sp/>call<sp/>a<sp/>judge<sp/>model</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>r.empty()<sp/>?<sp/>0.0<sp/>:<sp/>0.7;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::string<sp/>name()</highlight><highlight class="keyword"><sp/>const<sp/>override<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">{<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;my-llm&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;<sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">};</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
